# Implementation Plan - Branding Cleanup & Design Refinement

The goal is to remove all "MediSync" references, refine the overall design via [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css), and ensure the Navbar is only visible when the user is logged in.

## Proposed Changes

### [Design & Branding]
#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css)
- Implement a more sophisticated dark design system.
- Add better variables for backgrounds, borders, and glassmorphism.
- Refine typography and smooth scrolling.

#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/Navbar.tsx)
- Replace "MediSync" with "DevAuth".
- Update branding icon (M -> D).
- Remove "Sign In" and "Get Started" links from the main Navbar as it will only show when logged in (replace with Dashboard/Profile).

#### [MODIFY] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- Remove all "MediSync" text in descriptions and branding panels.
- Replace with "DevAuth" and updated technical copy.

### [Logic & Navigation]
#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/layout.tsx)
- Check for authenticated user using [getAuthenticatedUser()](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/modules/users/users.service.ts#118-142).
- Conditionally render the [Navbar](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/Navbar.tsx#9-59).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Branding Check**: Verify no mention of "MediSync" remains in the UI.
- **Session Check**: 
    - Log out and verify the Navbar is hidden on the login/register pages.
    - Log in and verify the Navbar appears on the dashboard.
- **Visual Polish**: Ensure the new [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css) styles look consistent and premium.
